  "source": "BBB_V2_AUDIT.md section 4; rpc.c:315-386, 921-939, 3382-3471; bbb_client.c:786-812, 968-981; bbb.go:154-186, 253-266; bbb_dispatch.c:417-433",
  "checked_by": "framing round-trip now; envelope semantics land with the RPC layer (build-order step 3+)",
